('WH-019','r','Sawyers Bay','8 Constant Street','dog','m','CAUTION','If you hear a dog, don''t go in','Listen before entering.'),
('WH-020','r','Sawyers Bay','10 Constant Street','dog','h','NO-GO','Rottweiler – lunges at you at the letterbox','Never enter the property. Deliver to the letterbox only when the dog is not out. Do not trust it.'),
